    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tell the people of Israel to turn back and encamp in front of Pi-ha-hiroth, between Migdol and the sea, in front of Baal-zephon; you shall encamp over against it, by the sea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Pharaoh will say of the people of Israel, ‘They are entangled in the land; the wilderness has shut them in.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will harden Pharaoh's heart, and he will pursue them and I will get glory over Pharaoh and all his host; and the Egyptians shall know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” And they did so.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the king of Egypt was told that the people had fled, the mind of Pharaoh and his servants was changed toward the people, and they said, “What is this we have done, that we have let Israel go from serving us?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he made ready his chariot and took his army with him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and took six hundred picked chariots and all the other chariots of Egypt with officers over all of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 13.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hardened the heart of Pharaoh king of Egypt and he pursued the people of Israel as they went forth defiantly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Egyptians pursued them, all Pharaoh's horses and chariots and his horsemen and his army, and overtook them encamped at the sea, by Pi-ha-hiroth, in front of Baal-zephon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Pharaoh drew near, the people of Israel lifted up their eyes, and behold, the Egyptians were marching after them; and they were in great fear. And the people of Israel cried out to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they said to Moses, “Is it because there are no graves in Egypt that you have taken us away to die in the wilderness? What have you done to us, in bringing us out of Egypt? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 16.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Is not this what we said to you in Egypt, ‘Let us alone and let us serve the Egyptians’? For it would have been better for us to serve the Egyptians than to die in the wilderness.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said to the people, “Fear not, stand firm, and see the salvation of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", which he will work for you today; for the Egyptians whom you see today, you shall never see again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will fight for you, and you have only to be still.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Why do you cry to me? Tell the people of Israel to go forward. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lift up your rod, and stretch out your hand over the sea and divide it, that the people of Israel may go on dry ground through the sea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will harden the hearts of the Egyptians so that they shall go in after them, and I will get glory over Pharaoh and all his host, his chariots, and his horsemen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Egyptians shall know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I have gotten glory over Pharaoh, his chariots, and his horsemen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel of God who went before the host of Israel moved and went behind them; and the pillar of cloud moved from before them and stood behind them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "coming between the host of Egypt and the host of Israel. And there was the cloud and the darkness; and the night passed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and it lit up the night",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " without one coming near the other all night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses stretched out his hand over the sea; and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " drove the sea back by a strong east wind all night, and made the sea dry land, and the waters were divided. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people of Israel went into the midst of the sea on dry ground, the waters being a wall to them on their right hand and on their left. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Egyptians pursued, and went in after them into the midst of the sea, all Pharaoh's horses, his chariots, and his horsemen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in the morning watch the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in the pillar of fire and of cloud looked down upon the host of the Egyptians, and discomfited the host of the Egyptians, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "clogging",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "binding.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sam Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "removing",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " their chariot wheels so that they drove heavily; and the Egyptians said, “Let us flee from before Israel; for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
